The following files and areas originate from dsh-logcat and were modified by
this project: lib/index.js, lib/client.js, lib/injector-jar.js,
tools/injector/Injector.java, and the panel UI/design surface.

Changes made by this project include the native/ADB backend abstraction,
unified screenshot coordinate handling and frame metadata, on-device Injector
deployment with fallback, the input_batch tool, the diagnostics panel, and
ZIP extraction without a system unzip binary.

